exports[`deployed Harness API through the real product Loader > exposes safe platform-failure narration and unknown-outcome recovery on both native media tools > generate_image 1`] = `"Generate images or edit reference images through the signed-in account relay and save every result into the artifacts directory. Quick completions return paths; longer operations return a background job_id with original plan_id and operation_id. Use job_output at measured intervals for progress and completion, then present the real paths. job_kill stops local waiting; accepted upstream work may continue billing. Never resubmit to wait for a background result. For pending or unknown results, never resubmit this tool: use query_image_task with the original plan_id and operation_id when a task_id was received. Without a task_id, retain the unknown outcome and reconcile the original request before any paid retry. For image-to-image requests, pass the current-chat user attachment or an authorized workspace image in reference_images. Use list_image_models when the requested model or image controls need checking; preserve its exact model ids, size strings, independent resolution tiers and count/reference limits. Ask the user to choose a model only when their request requires that choice. For failed operations, give users only a safe Simplified Chinese summary based on the observed failure category; connection failures and timeouts do not establish whether the cause is local, network, platform or upstream. Distinguish confirmed request or media validation, permission, rate limiting, service HTTP 5xx and upstream task failures; unknown causes remain unconfirmed; never repeat raw HTTP responses, diagnostic JSON, error codes, stacks, internal paths or credentials. Keep actionable guidance for confirmed sign-in, product-credit, file-validation and cancellation failures. When submission or billing outcome is unknown, check existing tasks and artifacts first; do not immediately retry or automatically resubmit. Preserve real tool results. This restriction does not prevent software or code diagnostics explicitly requested by the user."`;

exports[`deployed Harness API through the real product Loader > exposes safe platform-failure narration and unknown-outcome recovery on both native media tools > generate_video 1`] = `"Compatibility single-clip generation through the account relay. Read list_video_models first. Prefer generate_video_project for new video requests, including a single clip: its background job exposes queue and generation progress without holding chat open. Default to one finished work. For several user-requested works, first prepare_video_works with their concrete count and pass a separate returned work_id for each work. Reuse work_id when confirming, correcting or retrying the same finished work: even a new tool-call id returns its original operation instead of another generation POST. A separate actual human request can prepare independent work even with the same brief or plan, while the original accepted or unknown work retains its own task. Natural-language intent and inferred total counts do not gate execution. Progress checks and continuing the original task use its existing query or resume tools. Do not write submission, polling or download scripts or probe invalid paid durations. For story direction, character/reference continuity, dialogue or subtitles, use the yunshu-video-director skill. For a complete video such as 40 seconds or automatic assembly, always use generate_video_project; several camera beats may fit one clip. Accepted work that outlasts this foreground wait returns pending: query_video_task reads its original receipt without repeating that submission. Edit existing clips with edit_video. Only declared duration, resolution, ratio, frames and references are accepted.结合完整对话理解创作意图，不要求用户使用固定句式或反复重述数量。未指定数量默认一条；用户明确需要几条成片，就先用 prepare_video_works 准备对应数量，再逐个使用返回的 work_id 生成。单条简单请求可以直接生成，Host 自动准备一个默认作品编号。作品编号用于同一成片的防重复，不是从用户措辞推算的权限额度。普通确认、修改参数和继续同一作品时复用已有 work_id；尚未提交时可以纠正参数，已提交或结果未知时只查询、恢复原任务，不通过换工具调用或重新准备编号再生成。台词、字幕和故事里的疑问或否定不代表取消。准备同一请求会返回原作品清单，不增加版本；若已准备清单后，用户在真实问题回答中明确增加数量，先核对已有清单，再用 append_video_works 追加缺少的条数（已有一条改为总共三条时追加两条），保留原 work_id 和未知任务。同一回答重复追加不会再次加片，不能把普通确认、查询或重试当作追加指令。非 H3 报价选择只批准当前一件作品，追加作品分别核对实际报价；用户另行发起独立新请求时可以准备新的清单，即使提示词或计划相同，也不受旧任务等待或未知影响。清单中的待办不是必须执行的订单；用户减少数量时只启动其仍要求的作品，未启动的多余编号可以保留，不能为了清空清单生成。不要为了填满并发、质量评价或修改计划自动增加收费作品。是否另做仍不明确时只简短确认，不把正常对话说成平台拒绝。 For failed operations, give users only a safe Simplified Chinese summary based on the observed failure category; connection failures and timeouts do not establish whether the cause is local, network, platform or upstream. Distinguish confirmed request or media validation, permission, rate limiting, service HTTP 5xx and upstream task failures; unknown causes remain unconfirmed; never repeat raw HTTP responses, diagnostic JSON, error codes, stacks, internal paths or credentials. Keep actionable guidance for confirmed sign-in, product-credit, file-validation and cancellation failures. When submission or billing outcome is unknown, check existing tasks and artifacts first; do not immediately retry or automatically resubmit. Preserve real tool results. This restriction does not prevent software or code diagnostics explicitly requested by the user."`;

